From 726273c00ed7592876d7f965c4a52952be245420 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:56:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: make phish, AI, and cleanup actions visible

Show human-readable phish reasons with a score breakdown, prove
summaries stayed on-device, and list stripped params and deleted
cookies in chrome://aegis so the privacy claims can be checked.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
